WEBVTT

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:30.019
and sometimes it doesn't allow
for that to happen.

00:11:30.787 --> 00:11:32.555
CSB: Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:11:32.589 --> 00:11:34.390
Well, I think that's beautifully said

00:11:34.424 --> 00:11:36.459
and we've come to the end
of our time here.

00:11:36.492 --> 00:11:39.262
But I am so grateful to you
for this conversation, Naomi,

00:11:39.295 --> 00:11:41.731
and thank you for sharing all this.

00:11:41.731 --> 00:11:44.367
I'll talk to you soon. Take care.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.402
NS: Thank you, Cloe and everyone.

00:11:46.436 --> 00:11:47.570
Much love.